(YOJANAMITRA SCHEME REFERENCE   WOMEN) Tj T*
(Compiled from official Indian Government sources | Generated: 22 November 2026) Tj T*
(NOTICE: This is a reference document compiled by YojanaMitra. It is NOT an official government publication.) Tj T*
(For authoritative information, visit the official portal URLs listed for each scheme.) Tj T*
(========================================================================================) Tj T*
() Tj T*
([1]) Tj T*
(SCHEME: Pradhan Mantri Matru Vandana Yojana \(PMMVY\)) Tj T*
(ID: pmmvy) Tj T*
(Official Portal: https://www.wcd.gov.in/offerings/pradhan-mantri-matru-vandana-yojana) Tj T*
(Last Verified: 2026-11-21) Tj T*
(Source: Ministry of Women and Child Development, current PMMVY FAQ and Mission Shakti information; eligibility and facility implementation may be subject to current government instructions.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(DESCRIPTION:) Tj T*
(  Maternity benefit for eligible pregnant and lactating women from listed socially and) Tj T*
(  economically disadvantaged groups, supporting health-seeking behaviour.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(BENEFICIARIES:) Tj T*
(  Eligible pregnant and lactating women meeting at least one Ministry-listed category.) Tj T*
(  Benefits cover the first living child, and a second living child when the second) Tj T*
(  child is a girl.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(ELIGIBILITY:) Tj T*
(  ['The beneficiary must meet at least one listed category: Scheduled Caste or) Tj T*
(  Scheduled Tribe; partially \(40%\) or fully disabled; BPL ration-card holder; PM-JAY) Tj T*
(  beneficiary; e-Shram card holder; woman farmer benefiting under PM-KISAN; MGNREGA) Tj T*
(  job-card holder; net family income below  8 lakh per year; pregnant or lactating AWW,) Tj T*
(  AWH or ASHA; or NFSA ration-card holder. The Central Government may prescribe) Tj T*
(  additional categories.', 'Women in regular employment with the Central Government, a) Tj T*
(  State Government or a Public Sector Undertaking, and women receiving similar) Tj T*
(  maternity benefits under another law, are excluded.', 'The stated eligible) Tj T*
(  beneficiary age is 18 years 7 months up to 55 years. Confirm current age and any) Tj T*
(  case-specific rule with the PMMVY portal or implementing authority.', 'For the first-) Tj T*
(  child first installment: pregnancy registration and at least two antenatal check-ups) Tj T*
(  \(ANC\), preferably within six months from LMP, at an Anganwadi Centre or approved) Tj T*
(  health facility identified by the State/UT.', 'For the first-child second) Tj T*
(  installment: childbirth must be registered and the child must complete the first) Tj T*
(  cycle of immunization \(14 weeks\).', 'For a second living child who is a girl:) Tj T*
(  pregnancy registration and at least two ANC, preferably within six months from LMP;) Tj T*
(  registered childbirth; and completion of the first immunization cycle \(14 weeks\).',) Tj T*
(  'Facility designation and implementation details may vary by State/UT; consult the) Tj T*
(  current official PMMVY instructions.']) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(BENEFITS:) Tj T*
(  - For the first living child,  5,000 in two installments:  3,000 after the) Tj T*
(pregnancy-registration and at-least-two-ANC condition; then  2,000 after registered) Tj T*
(childbirth and completion of the first immunization cycle \(14 weeks\).) Tj T*
(  - For a second living child who is a girl,  6,000 in one installment after) Tj T*
(pregnancy registration, at least two ANC, registered childbirth and completion of the) Tj T*
(first immunization cycle \(14 weeks\).) Tj T*
() Tj T*
ET
