(HOW TO APPLY:) Tj T*
(  ['An eligible woman can register directly through the official PMMVY portal using) Tj T*
(  citizen login, or request an Anganwadi Worker \(AWW\) or ASHA worker to submit the) Tj T*
(  online application.', "The Ministry lists the beneficiary's Aadhaar number, MCP/RCHI) Tj T*
(  card, and one document proving a listed eligibility category. Supporting application) Tj T*
(  details/documents include Aadhaar-mapped bank or post-office account details, mobile) Tj T*
(  number, eligibility proof, LMP and ANC dates, birth certificate and child) Tj T*
(  immunization details.", "Aadhaar of the beneficiary's husband is not mandatory.) Tj T*
(  Follow the portal's current instructions and the designated State/UT AWC or approved) Tj T*
(  health-facility process; current submission time limits should be checked on the) Tj T*
(  official portal."]) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj T*
() Tj T*
([2]) Tj T*
(SCHEME: Sukanya Samriddhi Account \(SSA\)) Tj T*
(ID: sukanya-samriddhi) Tj T*
(Official Portal: https://www.indiapost.gov.in/banking-services/savings) Tj T*
(Last Verified: 2026-11-21) Tj T*
(Source: India Post, Sukanya Samriddhi Account information and account rules) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(DESCRIPTION:) Tj T*
(  Government-backed small-savings account opened by a guardian for a girl child.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(BENEFICIARIES:) Tj T*
(  A girl child under 10 years of age; the account is opened and operated by a natural) Tj T*
(  or legal guardian until applicable age rules permit the account holder to operate it.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(ELIGIBILITY:) Tj T*
(  ['The account is opened in the name of an eligible girl child under the current) Tj T*
(  scheme rules.', 'Account-number limits, deposits, withdrawal conditions and permitted) Tj T*
(  exceptions follow the notified rules.']) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(BENEFITS:) Tj T*
(  - Savings earn the Government-notified interest rate, which is revised) Tj T*
(periodically. The account matures 21 years after opening; eligible partial) Tj T*
(withdrawals are permitted under scheme rules.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(HOW TO APPLY:) Tj T*
(  ['A guardian can open an account at a post office or participating bank with the) Tj T*
(  required account-opening documents and deposit.']) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj T*
() Tj T*
([3]) Tj T*
(SCHEME: Pradhan Mantri Ujjwala Yojana \(PMUY\)) Tj T*
(ID: pm-ujjwala) Tj T*
(Official Portal: https://www.pmuy.gov.in/about.html) Tj T*
(Last Verified: 2026-11-21) Tj T*
(Source: Ministry of Petroleum and Natural Gas, PMUY official portal and FAQ) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(DESCRIPTION:) Tj T*
