(  Supports access to LPG connections for eligible adult women in poor households.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(BENEFICIARIES:) Tj T*
(  Adult women in eligible poor households that do not already have an LPG connection in) Tj T*
(  the household.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(ELIGIBILITY:) Tj T*
(  ['The applicant must be a woman aged 18 or older.', 'No other LPG connection may be) Tj T*
(  registered in the household; the household must satisfy the current poor-) Tj T*
(  household/deprivation criteria and documentation rules.']) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(BENEFITS:) Tj T*
(  - A deposit-free LPG connection package under current PMUY rules. First-refill,) Tj T*
(stove and subsidy support are subject to current scheme provisions and notifications.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(HOW TO APPLY:) Tj T*
(  ['Submit an application to an LPG distributor or through the official PMUY online) Tj T*
(  application route.', 'Complete KYC and provide the prescribed household, identity,) Tj T*
(  bank and deprivation documents.']) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj T*
() Tj T*
([4]) Tj T*
(SCHEME: Deendayal Antyodaya Yojana   National Rural Livelihoods Mission \(DAY-NRLM\)) Tj T*
(ID: day-nrlm) Tj T*
(Official Portal: https://www.rbi.org.in/scripts/NotificationUser.aspx?Id=12665) Tj T*
(Last Verified: 2026-11-21) Tj T*
(Source: Ministry of Rural Development DAY-NRLM policy, consolidated in the Reserve Bank of India master circular) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(DESCRIPTION:) Tj T*
(  Organizes rural poor women into self-help groups and supports livelihoods, financial) Tj T*
(  inclusion and community institutions.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(BENEFICIARIES:) Tj T*
(  Rural poor households mobilized into women-led Self-Help Groups and eligible SHG) Tj T*
(  federations under the State Rural Livelihoods Mission.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(ELIGIBILITY:) Tj T*
(  ['Group formation and inclusion are undertaken through State/UT rural livelihood) Tj T*
(  missions using their community-mobilization processes.', 'Revolving Fund support is) Tj T*
(  for eligible SHGs meeting the current existence, record-keeping and group-practice) Tj T*
(  conditions; support is not an individual cash grant.']) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(BENEFITS:) Tj T*
(  - Eligible SHGs may receive a  20,000  30,000 Revolving Fund corpus and Community) Tj T*
(Investment Fund routed through federations, along with bank linkage, livelihood and) Tj T*
(skill support. State plans and group eligibility govern access.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(HOW TO APPLY:) Tj T*
(  ['Contact the local women SHG, Village Organization, Block Mission Management Unit or) Tj T*
(  State Rural Livelihoods Mission to join or learn about group formation.', 'Funds are) Tj T*
(  routed through eligible community institutions and federations, not applied for as an) Tj T*
